# shim "real" (track W11): compile against the real Vitis HLS 2025.1 headers, the way the Vitis
# front end does (autopilot.flow.log:331 of every cached run: -I <autopilot tree>, the synthesis
# macros, -include etc/autopilot_ssdm_op.h; C++ also -fno-threadsafe-statics -fno-use-cxa-atexit),
# plus cgeist's Xilinx extensions. Needs a cgeist with --xlx-prelude / -Xclang and a clang with
# -fxlx-bitwidth (Polygeist branch w11-real-headers). See README.md.
--xlx-prelude
-I /mnt/a/Vitis/2025.1/Vitis/common/technology/autopilot
-D__SYNTHESIS__ -D__VITIS_HLS__ -DAESL_SYN -D__HLS_SYN__ -D__DSP48E1__
-include /mnt/a/Vitis/2025.1/Vitis/common/technology/autopilot/etc/autopilot_ssdm_op.h
-Xclang -fxlx-bitwidth -Xclang -fxlx-apint-promote
-Xclang -fnative-half-type -Xclang -fnative-half-arguments-and-returns
-Xclang -Wno-unknown-attributes
# Vitis' C++-only flags, passed to cc1 (accepted for C too, where they have no effect).
-Xclang -fno-threadsafe-statics -Xclang -fno-use-cxa-atexit
--scalar-wrapper-abi --xlx-headers
# A pipeline pragma on a loop of trip count 1 unrolls every loop nested in it completely, as Vitis
# does, before cgeist folds the trip-1 loop away (OPEN_ISSUES O57, VITIS_NOTES N40; cgeist option of
# Polygeist W9r5-impl, adopted in W9r12-impl: only the three
# MultiHeadSelfAttention1 opt5 designs change, 2304 -> 2880 against Vitis 2688, bit-exact).
--hls-trip-one-pipeline-unroll
# Vitis' automatic inlining measures a function in loop-rotated form (VITIS_NOTES N131, OPEN_ISSUES O175;
# adopted in W9r17-impl: machsuite sort_merge 8 -> 4 = Vitis, N18 kernels 127 -> 130 of 132 decisions),
# and keeps an `inline off` call whatever its array argument's size (N123, O167; adopted in W9r17-impl:
# forgebench attn_breakdown_module / op2 22 -> 17 = Vitis). Both need Polygeist w9r17-cgeist.
--hls-auto-inline-rotated-size
--hls-keep-misfit-inline-off
